OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog patches in
OL,6,Frural spots steadily clear leaving a
OL,7,Fdry day for most with sunny spells. A
OL,8,Fchance of the odd shower at first
OL,9,Falong southern coasts. Light winds and
OL,10,Fmild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry night with variable
OL,13,Fcloud and clear spells. Winds remain
OL,14,Flight, with the odd mist and fog patch
OL,15,Fforming in prone spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FEarly low cloud clears leaving
OL,18,Fa bright and dry day for many with
OL,19,Flight winds. Temperatures close to the
OL,20,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
